us Line is correct!", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T13:45:33Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "and Vats wins", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T13:46:01Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Lovely questions @⁨KP KVizzing⁩", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T13:46:08Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Chorus Line, a play about how Broadway dancers find their way into the profession, and deal with their individual personalities while playing a different persona on stage", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T13:46:10Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Beautiful framing of questions @⁨KP KVizzing⁩\nSubtle hints but great hints 🙌🏻", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]